    "text": "<p>The number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for which the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;has no solution is</p>",
